      ## Traits

      ***Bloodied Fury.*** While ***Bloodied***, the boar has ***Advantage*** on attack rolls.

      ## Actions

      ***Gore.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=To Hit [Gore]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=1d6+1,dicelabel=Damage [Gore]) Piercing damage. If the target is a Medium or smaller creature and the boar moved 20+ feet straight toward it immediately before the hit, the target takes an extra rollable(dice=1d6,dicelabel=Damage [Gore]) Piercing damage and has the ***Prone*** condition.

